### ============================================================
### NOVABANK GATEWAY - HTTP TEST COLLECTION
### ============================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### ============================================================
### GATEWAY HEALTH
### ============================================================

### Gateway Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### ============================================================
### AUTH SERVICE
### ============================================================

### Generate development JWT
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/token

### Validate JWT
@authToken = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJ1c2VyLTEyMyIsInJvbGUiOiJjdXN0b21lciIsImlhdCI6MTc4Njk4NDQ3MCwiZXhwIjoxNzg2OTg4MDcwfQ.Dp2PMu_6M3j16x-ALNN3HSjOkDOdV-GzfhU9vgO6cJk
