### Validate malformed Authorization header
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/validate
Authorization: Bad token

### ============================================================
### CUSTOMER SERVICE
### ============================================================

### Get Customer 123
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/customers/123
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}


### Get Customer 456
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/customers/456
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}


### Get Non-existent Customer
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/customers/999
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}


### ============================================================
### ACCOUNT SERVICE
### ============================================================

### Get Account 456
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/456
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}


### Get Another Account
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/789
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}


### ============================================================
### PAYMENT SERVICE
### ============================================================

### Create Payment
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "fromAccount": "A100",
  "toAccount": "A200",
  "amount": 100
}


### Create Larger Payment
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "fromAccount": "A100",
  "toAccount": "A300",
  "amount": 1500
}


### Get Payment
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/12345
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}


### ============================================================
### NEGATIVE / ROUTING TESTS
### ============================================================

### Unknown Gateway Route
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/unknown


### Unknown Customer Route
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}


### Unknown Account Route
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}


### Unknown Payment Route
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}


### Wrong HTTP Method - Customer
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/customers/123
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "name": "Test"
}


### Wrong HTTP Method - Account
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/456
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "currency": "USD"
}


### Wrong HTTP Method - Payment
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}